<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - First Boston ups paper stocks.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - First Boston ups paper stocks.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>CS First Boston said it raised the rating on three paper/timber stocks to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- The three stocks are Gaylord Container Corp, Jefferson Smurfit Corp and Stone Container Corp .</p>
<p>-- analysts Bill Wigder and Laura Drynan were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Stone rose 7/8 to 12-7/8, Jefferson gained 3/8 to 17-3/4 and Gaylord was up 7/16 to 7-9/16.</p>
</text>
